{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_133_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"一、元年，春，王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"二、二月，辛酉，葬我君宣公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"三、無冰。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"終時無冰則志。此未終時而言無冰何也？終無冰矣，加之寒之辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"四、三月，作丘甲。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"作，為也，丘為甲也。丘甲，國之事也。丘作甲，非正也。丘作甲之為非正何也？古者，立國家，百官具，農工皆有職以事上。古者，有四民，有士民，有商民，有農民，有工民。夫甲，非人人之所能為也。丘作甲，非正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"五、夏，臧孫許及晉侯盟於赤棘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"六、秋，王師敗績於貿戎。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"不言戰，莫之敢敵也。為尊者諱敵不諱敗，為親者諱敗不諱敵，尊尊親親之義也。然則孰敗之？晉也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"八、（無經）","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_133_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_133","textTraditional":"季孫行父禿，晉郤克眇，衞孫良夫跛，曹公子手僂，同時聘於齊。齊侯使禿者御禿者，使眇者御眇者，使跛者御跛者，使僂者御僂者。蕭同姪子處臺上而笑之。聞於客，客不說而去，相與立胥閭而語，移日不解。齊人有知之者曰：「齊之患，必自此始矣。」","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}